### Customer proxy – happy paths
@mi = http://localhost:8290
@gw = https://localhost:8243/jamii
@base = {{mi}}/customers
# @base = {{gw}}/customers/v1
@token = paste-oauth2-access-token

### Known customer (expect 200, body passed through, Cache-Control: no-store)
GET {{base}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Caller-supplied correlation id is kept and echoed back
GET {{base}}/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-ID: demo-cust-0002

### Internal headers are stripped before the backend call
# Use the local mock backend and watch `docker compose logs -f customer-mock`:
# X-Internal-Debug and Authorization do not arrive, X-Correlation-ID does.
GET {{base}}/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Internal-Debug: true
X-Internal-User-Id: teller-42
